<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 5px; }
        .header { background-color: #f43f5e; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0; }
        .content { padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .otp-code { font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 5px; color: #f43f5e; margin: 20px 0; background: #fff1f2; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block; }
        .footer { text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #777; margin-top: 20px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Reset Your Password</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello,</p>
            <p>We received a request to reset your password for your <%= appName %> account.</p>
            
            <p>Use the code below to reset it:</p>
            
            <div class="otp-code"><%= resetUrl %></div>
            
            <p>This code will expire in 15 minutes.</p>
            <p>If you didn't request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; <%= year %> <%= appName %>. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
